2026-07-27T08:50:14.4515388Z i /tmp/RtmpLYoroU/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:50:14.4515728Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:50:14.4516127Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:50:14.4516786Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:50:14.4517332Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:50:14.4518108Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:50:14.4518705Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
